* SECU1 -- User access control inquiry screen
MAP SECU1 SIZE 24x80
  FIELD HEADER    AT 0,2   LEN 60 PROT BRIGHT COLOR=WHITE
  FIELD USERID    AT 2,20  LEN 8  PROT BRIGHT COLOR=WHITE
  FIELD MAXAUTH   AT 4,20  LEN 4  PROT BRIGHT COLOR=TURQUOISE
  FIELD LASTVIOL  AT 5,20  LEN 10 PROT DIM    COLOR=YELLOW
  FIELD VIOLCDSP  AT 5,35  LEN 4  PROT BRIGHT COLOR=YELLOW
  FIELD STATUSF   AT 6,20  LEN 1  PROT BRIGHT COLOR=GREEN
  FIELD MESSAGE   AT 8,5   LEN 60 PROT DIM    COLOR=WHITE
  FIELD FOOTER    AT 23,2  LEN 60 PROT DIM    COLOR=BLUE
ENDMAP
